WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

3
01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

4
01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel, Orchid Fragrance Fate)

5
01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 30= (This drama does not correspond)

6
01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

7
01:38.210 --> 01:41.160
(The systems, culture, attire and other dynastic elements have been adapted.)

8
01:46.312 --> 01:47.230
I want to take a bath.

9
02:14.120 --> 02:17.280
It's cramped on the ship, so I accidentally

10
02:18.960 --> 02:19.910
bump into you.

11
02:25.368 --> 02:27.280
(Though I've never seen reed down shoes,)

12
02:28.488 --> 02:30.040
(I've still fought with all my might)

13
02:31.120 --> 02:32.360
(just to stay alive.)

14
02:41.960 --> 02:42.840
Don't catch a chill.

15
02:50.630 --> 02:52.430
Lan... Lanxiang.

16
02:57.520 --> 02:59.590
I... I'm seasick.

17
03:03.310 --> 03:04.430
I feel weak all over.

18
03:05.190 --> 03:07.000
I... I can't stand up.

19
03:08.400 --> 03:09.680
I don't have any strength at all.

20
03:11.030 --> 03:11.800
I'm so dizzy.

21
03:14.190 --> 03:15.840
You get seasick?

22
03:19.190 --> 03:20.560
I've never been seasick before.

23
03:21.120 --> 03:22.150
Maybe

24
03:24.216 --> 03:25.710
I didn't get enough rest last night.

25
03:38.680 --> 03:39.800
Maybe you caught a chill.

26
03:41.150 --> 03:42.280
If you've caught a chill,

27
03:43.304 --> 03:44.710
you shouldn't soak in the bath.

28
03:47.630 --> 03:48.630
Go lie down in bed.

29
03:51.288 --> 03:52.870
Young Master has caught a chill.

30
03:53.176 --> 03:54.430
Make him a bowl of ginger tea.

31
04:05.752 --> 04:07.120
After you drink the ginger tea,

32
04:07.590 --> 04:08.776
bundle up and work up a sweat.

33
04:08.792 --> 04:10.770
Once you sweat out the chill, you'll feel better.

34
04:14.120 --> 04:16.040
If you feel sleepy, get some rest.

35
04:18.430 --> 04:19.120
Lanxiang.

36
04:21.672 --> 04:23.416
Are you feeling unwell anywhere else?

37
04:25.270 --> 04:27.390
I'm fine. Don't worry.

38
04:29.600 --> 04:30.310
I'm leaving.

39
04:43.870 --> 04:45.190
It worked out by accident.

40
04:46.070 --> 04:47.510
At least she's not angry anymore.

41
04:50.860 --> 04:57.830
(The Capital)

42
04:57.830 --> 05:01.630
By the Mandate of Heaven, the Emperor decrees.

43
05:02.000 --> 05:06.360
The Shenji Battalion guards the capital and stands ready for military campaigns.

44
05:06.430 --> 05:11.070
It commands firearms, the most vital weapons of war.

45
05:11.390 --> 05:13.750
Such responsibility shall only be entrusted

46
05:13.870 --> 05:15.950
to men of proven ability and mature judgment.

47
05:16.680 --> 05:20.070
Lin Jinqi, you are a man of exceptional talent,

48
05:20.070 --> 05:21.750
upright and incorruptible in conduct.

49
05:22.200 --> 05:23.576
Your merits are well known to me.

50
05:23.608 --> 05:26.230
(Enduring Merit and Lasting Honor) Therefore, I hereby promote you

51
05:26.248 --> 05:28.390
to Assistant Commander of the Central Military Command

52
05:28.630 --> 05:31.600
and appoint you to jointly oversee the Shenji Battalion.

53
05:31.950 --> 05:36.160
Devote yourself to public service and lead your men with loyalty.

54
05:36.310 --> 05:40.040
Maintain strict discipline and further the work entrusted to you.

55
05:40.070 --> 05:44.000
Honor this imperial decree. Obey with reverence.

56
05:47.750 --> 05:49.870
Mother, we're here.

57
05:53.720 --> 05:55.190
Mother, come quickly.

58
05:56.390 --> 05:57.160
It's beautiful.

59
05:57.160 --> 05:58.390
Look how happy you are.

60
06:34.160 --> 06:36.750
- First Madam! Young Lady! - First Madam! Young Lady!

61
06:47.848 --> 06:50.504
- Young Master. Young Madam. - Young Master. Young Madam.

62
06:56.870 --> 06:58.040
Xiulai is here!

63
06:58.120 --> 06:58.920
Xiulai.

64
07:02.270 --> 07:03.120
Xiulai.

65
07:04.040 --> 07:04.860
(Lin Xiulai) Jinqi.

66
07:04.870 --> 07:06.270
(Daughter of Lin Changzheng's concubine, Eldest Young Lady of the Lin family.)

67
07:06.270 --> 07:06.830
Aunt Lingxiao.

68
07:06.830 --> 07:08.600
(Lu Jian, Lin Xiulai's husband.)

69
07:10.488 --> 07:12.744
Ever since she heard Jinqi and Aunt Lingxiao were coming,

70
07:12.950 --> 07:14.600
she's been waiting day and night.

71
07:15.070 --> 07:16.480
At last, you're finally here.

72
07:16.984 --> 07:18.720
The snow is heavy outside. It's too cold.

73
07:18.870 --> 07:20.920
Let's get inside and catch up once we're warm.

74
07:22.360 --> 07:24.360
Jian is right. Let's all go inside.

75
07:25.270 --> 07:27.600
Yes, let's get inside and warm up.

76
07:41.040 --> 07:41.720
Lanxiang.

77
07:42.552 --> 07:43.656
Are you feeling unwell?

78
07:46.190 --> 07:47.510
Is this your residence?

79
07:50.190 --> 07:51.040
Years ago,

80
07:51.080 --> 07:52.800
when Grandfather was Minister of Personnel,

81
07:53.190 --> 07:54.360
he had a residence here.

82
07:55.240 --> 07:57.430
But property in the capital is extremely expensive.

83
07:57.848 --> 07:59.390
After Grandfather retired from office,

84
07:59.750 --> 08:02.070
he had no choice but to give up that residence.

85
08:04.776 --> 08:06.760
His Majesty recently granted me this residence.

86
08:08.070 --> 08:09.390
Xiulai and Jian

87
08:09.400 --> 08:10.936
just finished getting it ready for us.

88
08:19.510 --> 08:21.480
Jinqi, let's go inside.

89
08:30.000 --> 08:30.480
Let's go.

90
08:48.720 --> 08:51.030
- First Madam. Young Lady. - First Madam. Young Lady.

91
09:03.740 --> 09:07.860
♪Spring slips from the branches once more♪

92
09:10.740 --> 09:14.780
♪Flowers bloom unseen, as they have before♪

93
09:16.584 --> 09:18.720
- First Madam. Young Lady. - First Madam. Young Lady.

94
09:20.940 --> 09:23.620
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

95
09:24.540 --> 09:26.780
♪Though all the world may fade♪

96
09:26.780 --> 09:29.180
♪Time rolls on as countless lives rush by♪

97
09:29.768 --> 09:31.960
- First Madam. Young Lady. - First Madam. Young Lady.

98
09:31.960 --> 09:35.620
♪Night winds wander through the halls of long ago♪

99
09:38.300 --> 09:42.660
♪No page could hold the longing words can never show♪

100
09:45.270 --> 09:46.550
Jialan!

101
09:48.860 --> 09:51.500
♪Fades into the past as new wounds rise♪

102
09:55.390 --> 09:57.000
Jialan!

103
09:58.820 --> 10:02.700
♪Let the cold wind rage, let the wild rain fall♪

104
10:04.150 --> 10:05.030
Jialan!

105
10:06.140 --> 10:09.780
♪Let love fall to pieces, let old anger burn away♪

106
10:09.780 --> 10:12.540
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

107
10:12.540 --> 10:16.740
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

108
10:16.740 --> 10:19.980
♪And silver moonlight to guide me through the night♪

109
10:19.980 --> 10:23.700
♪Let beginnings fade as endings come to call♪

110
10:23.700 --> 10:28.300
♪From this endless dream, there's no return at all♪

111
10:32.960 --> 10:34.150
Aunt Lanxiang.

112
10:34.150 --> 10:35.560
(Lu Yingzhi, daughter of Lin Xiulai)

113
10:41.550 --> 10:43.030
It's already the Hour of Si.

114
10:43.150 --> 10:45.360
Why haven't the Lin family arrived yet?

115
10:45.390 --> 10:46.080
Madam.

116
10:46.750 --> 10:49.080
This is Young Lady's birthdate card.

117
10:50.080 --> 10:51.320
And this other one...

118
10:51.960 --> 10:52.870
(Does the Lin family)

119
10:53.656 --> 10:55.270
(intend to call off the engagement?)

120
10:56.030 --> 10:57.550
The Lin family has gone too far.

121
11:10.840 --> 11:13.360
This is Xiulai's daughter, Yingzhi.

122
11:20.440 --> 11:22.200
(Jialan is so thoughtful and attentive.)

123
11:22.840 --> 11:25.150
(She's truly your daughter.)

124
11:25.320 --> 11:26.760
(When it comes to being thoughtful,)

125
11:26.840 --> 11:28.550
(how could we ever compare)

126
11:28.550 --> 11:30.510
(with Old Madam and her countless clever ideas?)

127
11:33.720 --> 11:35.510
(Old Madam taught us well.)

128
11:37.150 --> 11:39.390
(Tonight, we sisters can chat by the fire.)

129
11:39.608 --> 11:40.960
(I guarantee you'll eat your fill.)

130
11:41.270 --> 11:44.550
(It's settled. We'll see each other tonight.)

131
11:45.080 --> 11:46.030
See you tonight.

132
11:52.260 --> 11:56.420
♪Let the cold wind rage, let the wild rain fall♪

133
11:56.420 --> 11:59.540
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

134
11:59.860 --> 12:03.540
♪Let love fall to pieces, let old anger burn away♪

135
12:03.540 --> 12:06.220
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

136
12:07.750 --> 12:08.240
By the way,

137
12:08.720 --> 12:09.790
Xiulai also has a son

138
12:09.910 --> 12:10.510
named Jun.

139
12:11.150 --> 12:13.360
He should be at school today.

140
12:13.432 --> 12:14.670
You'll meet him another day.

141
12:14.670 --> 12:17.580
♪Let beginnings fade as endings come to call♪

142
12:17.580 --> 12:20.020
♪From this endless dream, there's no return at all♪

143
12:20.030 --> 12:20.630
Jinqi.

144
12:21.080 --> 12:23.150
Aunt Lingxiao said it's been a tiring journey,

145
12:23.390 --> 12:24.840
and Jinlan isn't very strong either,

146
12:24.910 --> 12:26.320
so she had Jinlan and Suhua

147
12:26.320 --> 12:27.928
return to their courtyard to rest first.

148
12:28.120 --> 12:29.270
Aunt Lingxiao and Xiuwan

149
12:29.270 --> 12:30.750
have also gone to wash up and rest.

150
12:31.150 --> 12:33.270
We can all catch up over dinner later.

151
12:33.880 --> 12:35.576
That was thoughtful of Aunt Lingxiao.

152
12:35.840 --> 12:37.960
We're all family. No need for formalities.

153
12:38.480 --> 12:40.600
We'll take you and Lanxiang to your courtyard to rest.

154
12:40.910 --> 12:41.390
No need.

155
12:41.870 --> 12:42.750
I know the way.

156
12:43.000 --> 12:44.200
Go tend to your own affairs.

157
12:45.200 --> 12:45.670
Yingzhi.

158
12:45.960 --> 12:47.030
Go on. Go find your father.

159
12:47.960 --> 12:48.440
Come here.

160
12:56.150 --> 12:57.670
You don't even want me anymore?

161
12:58.030 --> 12:59.390
Do you like your uncle that much?

162
12:59.790 --> 13:01.960
Then how about becoming his daughter?

163
13:03.840 --> 13:04.600
Come here, Yingzhi.

164
13:12.870 --> 13:14.600
I like you, too.

165
13:30.648 --> 13:33.112
Come help Young Madam wash up and get some rest.

166
13:36.670 --> 13:37.360
Young Madam.

167
13:58.840 --> 14:00.240
What are you standing there for?

168
14:00.480 --> 14:01.600
Hurry and go with them.

169
14:03.390 --> 14:05.200
See if Jinqi's courtyard is missing anything

170
14:05.656 --> 14:07.016
or if anything isn't to his liking.

171
14:07.080 --> 14:09.368
Add whatever is needed and fix whatever isn't right.

172
14:11.270 --> 14:12.630
Maybe Jinqi wants

173
14:12.630 --> 14:13.910
some time alone with Lanxiang.

174
14:14.360 --> 14:16.600
It wouldn't be right for me to tag along.

175
14:30.390 --> 14:33.360
You and Jinqi don't share the same mother.

176
14:34.216 --> 14:36.392
If you don't hurry up and get on his good side,

177
14:36.440 --> 14:38.440
how are you going to ask him for an official post?

178
14:42.390 --> 14:45.510
I'm counting on you to secure a good position

179
14:46.328 --> 14:48.056
and keep rising through the ranks.

180
14:50.480 --> 14:54.790
Mother.

181
14:57.720 --> 14:58.360
Don't worry.

182
14:59.720 --> 15:00.360
Don't worry.

183
15:01.720 --> 15:03.080
I'll go ask Jinqi right now.

184
15:03.440 --> 15:04.200
I'll go now.

185
15:21.870 --> 15:24.120
Uncle Jinqi.

186
15:30.030 --> 15:31.120
Go get some rest, my lady.

187
15:31.480 --> 15:33.270
I have a few more words to say to Xiulai.

188
15:43.600 --> 15:45.080
You're a mother yourself now.

189
15:45.480 --> 15:47.200
Why are you still so flustered?

190
15:47.720 --> 15:49.480
What if you fall while carrying the child?

191
15:50.670 --> 15:51.670
You're right, Jinqi.

192
15:52.550 --> 15:53.750
I was careless.

193
15:55.440 --> 15:57.600
Did you come after me because something happened?

194
16:03.750 --> 16:04.750
All these years,

195
16:04.792 --> 16:06.968
you've been married and living alone in the capital,

196
16:07.270 --> 16:09.390
without any family of your own to rely on.

197
16:10.510 --> 16:11.790
Now that I'm here in the capital,

198
16:12.510 --> 16:14.790
if you ever need anything, just tell me.

199
16:17.096 --> 16:19.480
My husband passed the provincial examination at a young age,

200
16:19.500 --> 16:22.440
but he has repeatedly failed the metropolitan examination over the years.

201
16:22.488 --> 16:24.130
If he takes a teaching post under the usual system,

202
16:24.150 --> 16:25.510
his rank would be below the official grades,

203
16:25.550 --> 16:26.790
with little chance of promotion.

204
16:27.288 --> 16:29.544
If he enters the Imperial Academy to gain experience,

205
16:29.550 --> 16:32.290
there's no telling when he'll finally receive an official appointment.

206
16:33.960 --> 16:36.840
What kind of position does he have in mind?

207
16:41.720 --> 16:42.840
My husband said

208
16:44.000 --> 16:46.270
you're now highly trusted by His Majesty

209
16:46.696 --> 16:48.520
and in command of the Shenji Battalion.

210
16:49.440 --> 16:50.790
The Five Military Commissions

211
16:51.200 --> 16:53.200
would surely show you some consideration.

212
16:55.440 --> 16:56.390
Otherwise,

213
17:00.150 --> 17:01.480
the Ministry of War would also do.

214
17:05.944 --> 17:07.450
I've only just arrived in the capital,

215
17:07.832 --> 17:10.088
and there are still many things I need to sort out.

216
17:10.480 --> 17:13.160
Ask him to be patient a little longer.

217
17:13.790 --> 17:15.350
Once I've gotten everything in order,

218
17:15.720 --> 17:16.680
I'll give him an answer.

219
17:19.550 --> 17:20.200
All right.

220
17:46.820 --> 17:49.380
♪A lone figure wanders down the old lane♪

221
17:49.380 --> 17:52.220
♪The heart remembers what time cannot erase♪

222
17:53.300 --> 17:57.500
♪One thought brings sorrow, another dreams of brighter days♪

223
17:57.672 --> 17:59.976
Assaulting a free commoner adds one degree to the penalty.

224
18:00.024 --> 18:02.440
For a relative in the lesser mourning grade, add two degrees.

225
18:02.580 --> 18:04.900
♪Or what changes fate may bring♪

226
18:06.590 --> 18:07.400
Father.

227
18:09.528 --> 18:11.720
My copy of Direct Explanation of the Laws and Decrees

228
18:11.830 --> 18:13.070
is missing its final volume.

229
18:13.480 --> 18:15.510
Did you take it to read?

230
18:17.720 --> 18:18.590
(In a few days,)

231
18:18.680 --> 18:21.200
(invite the Lin family over for a tea gathering)

232
18:21.480 --> 18:23.640
so you can meet Jinqi.

233
18:23.960 --> 18:26.000
Jialan is bright and eager to learn.

234
18:27.160 --> 18:29.000
The Lin family is truly fortunate.

235
18:30.740 --> 18:33.340
♪I watch the bustling world come and go♪

236
18:36.110 --> 18:36.880
(Father.)

237
18:38.160 --> 18:39.070
(Mother.)

238
18:41.550 --> 18:42.880
(Your unfilial daughter Jialan)

239
18:44.160 --> 18:45.200
(has returned.)

240
18:52.300 --> 18:54.860
♪I walk through winding alleys♪

241
18:55.500 --> 18:57.820
♪And around weathered corridors♪

242
18:58.620 --> 19:03.060
♪One moment of peace brings a little brightness♪

243
19:06.350 --> 19:07.720
(It's...)

244
19:10.680 --> 19:12.030
(not the same as before.)

245
19:12.030 --> 19:16.420
♪I only wish for one gentle ray of light♪

246
19:17.220 --> 19:20.300
♪Step by step, page by page♪

247
19:20.300 --> 19:23.260
♪The portrait of my youth takes shape♪

248
19:23.260 --> 19:29.500
♪Let every doubt and restless turn be carried on the wind♪

249
19:29.860 --> 19:32.780
♪Chapter by chapter, journey by journey♪

250
19:32.780 --> 19:35.860
♪I watch the bustling world come and go♪

251
19:35.860 --> 19:42.780
♪And quietly wait for the light♪

252
19:44.750 --> 19:46.350
This courtyard is meant for the elders.

253
19:48.960 --> 19:50.070
Why did you come here?

254
19:50.360 --> 19:52.760
Didn't Butler Yang tell you which courtyard we're staying in?

255
19:53.480 --> 19:54.310
He did.

256
19:55.160 --> 19:57.550
But Young Madam said she liked this courtyard

257
19:57.640 --> 19:58.590
and wanted to stay here.

258
20:02.960 --> 20:04.310
Since Young Madam chose it,

259
20:04.880 --> 20:05.830
she can stay here.

260
20:19.240 --> 20:21.096
Do you really dislike the capital that much?

261
20:21.590 --> 20:23.070
You've seemed distracted

262
20:23.110 --> 20:24.264
and unhappy this whole time.

263
20:27.000 --> 20:28.070
Are you tired?

264
20:28.552 --> 20:29.750
I'll send for a physician.

265
20:30.480 --> 20:31.350
Lin Jinqi.

266
20:40.880 --> 20:41.550
What is it?

267
20:48.000 --> 20:49.200
I want to stay in the bedroom.

268
20:53.350 --> 20:54.480
That's all?

269
20:55.160 --> 20:55.640
All right.

270
20:55.864 --> 20:57.448
I'll stay in the side chamber.

271
21:11.880 --> 21:12.750
Before,

272
21:13.256 --> 21:15.000
you drugged me with knockout drug.

273
21:15.096 --> 21:16.310
It wasn't knockout drug.

274
21:17.480 --> 21:18.000
It was

275
21:18.550 --> 21:19.750
something to help you sleep.

276
21:22.310 --> 21:23.480
Do me a favor,

277
21:23.960 --> 21:25.110
and we'll be even.

278
21:29.750 --> 21:30.880
Whatever it is,

279
21:31.680 --> 21:32.790
whenever you need me,

280
21:33.790 --> 21:35.160
all you have to do is ask.

281
21:38.750 --> 21:40.110
I'd like to borrow Jiugao.

282
21:40.776 --> 21:42.168
I need him to help me find someone.

283
21:52.270 --> 21:53.110
Get out here!

284
21:53.790 --> 21:54.920
You little whore!

285
21:55.550 --> 21:56.750
Just what I'd expect

286
21:56.750 --> 21:57.750
from a brothel girl.

287
21:58.790 --> 22:00.310
You do nothing but laze around all day.

288
22:00.590 --> 22:03.270
All you know is how to flirt with those fox-like eyes of yours.

289
22:03.270 --> 22:05.240
Luring men into your bed, aren't you?

290
22:06.160 --> 22:07.030
Get up!

291
22:10.240 --> 22:12.070
Open your eyes and take a good look!

292
22:12.136 --> 22:14.110
It's your man who's been pestering me all day.

293
22:14.120 --> 22:16.670
You can't control your own man, so you take your anger out on me.

294
22:16.680 --> 22:18.360
If you've got the nerve, go hit your man.

295
22:18.440 --> 22:19.310
Go on, hit him!

296
22:20.000 --> 22:21.400
Why are they fighting again?

297
22:30.110 --> 22:30.680
You...

298
22:39.550 --> 22:40.590
Lanxiang.

299
22:45.350 --> 22:46.310
Lanxiang.

300
22:50.660 --> 22:55.860
♪The wind scatters the clouds, and rain turns to mud♪

301
22:57.110 --> 22:57.640
It's me.

302
22:59.240 --> 22:59.830
I'm sorry.

303
23:01.000 --> 23:01.830
I'm late.

304
23:04.750 --> 23:05.160
No.

305
23:06.550 --> 23:07.240
You're not late.

306
23:08.400 --> 23:09.550
Not at all.

307
23:10.500 --> 23:13.580
♪Pause, then rewind♪

308
23:16.790 --> 23:18.310
I knew you'd keep your word.

309
23:18.830 --> 23:20.750
I knew you'd come to save me.

310
23:22.000 --> 23:24.550
(You have to escape Yangzhou and return to Jinling.)

311
23:24.600 --> 23:26.456
(Don't let everything I've done be in vain.)

312
23:26.680 --> 23:27.480
(Wait for me.)

313
23:27.590 --> 23:29.350
(I'll come back and buy your freedom.)

314
23:29.480 --> 23:31.030
(I promise I'll get you out.)

315
23:31.432 --> 23:32.110
(All right.)

316
23:32.920 --> 23:33.830
(I'll wait for you.)

317
23:35.200 --> 23:36.640
(I'll wait for you to come save me.)

318
23:45.110 --> 23:46.000
Shopkeeper Qi.

319
23:46.680 --> 23:47.960
I'd like to buy Ji'er's freedom

320
23:47.960 --> 23:49.790
along with her maid Xiaopu's.

321
23:50.200 --> 23:51.440
Please name your price.

322
23:54.880 --> 23:55.920
She's only a woman.

323
23:55.944 --> 23:57.240
If you wish to take her with you,

324
23:57.350 --> 23:59.750
I'd gladly agree.

325
24:00.240 --> 24:01.070
But

326
24:01.310 --> 24:02.160
to tell you the truth,

327
24:02.350 --> 24:04.750
I'm only acting on behalf of my employer.

328
24:05.110 --> 24:06.110
Lv's indenture

329
24:06.110 --> 24:07.920
has already been taken by my employer's wife.

330
24:07.920 --> 24:09.480
So Lv's true madam now

331
24:09.480 --> 24:11.350
is my employer's wife.

332
24:12.584 --> 24:13.944
If it weren't for that,

333
24:14.350 --> 24:15.510
I would've sold

334
24:20.104 --> 24:20.960
that little whore...

335
24:21.550 --> 24:22.200
Lv long ago.

336
24:24.790 --> 24:26.200
Not long after I arrived here,

337
24:27.000 --> 24:29.440
I heard Qi Sihai say that his employer's wife had taken

338
24:29.440 --> 24:30.720
Xiaopu's indenture and mine,

339
24:31.480 --> 24:32.790
and had taken Xiaopu away as well.

340
24:33.400 --> 24:34.000
It's all right.

341
24:34.640 --> 24:35.640
We'll find his employer.

342
24:37.640 --> 24:39.790
May I ask your employer's name

343
24:39.830 --> 24:40.830
and where he lives?

344
24:46.056 --> 24:47.640
My employer's wife left instructions.

345
24:47.640 --> 24:50.350
(Invitation) If Young Madam Lin came looking for Lv,

346
24:50.550 --> 24:53.350
I was to give her this invitation.

347
24:53.720 --> 24:54.920
My employer's surname is Dai.

348
24:54.930 --> 24:57.368
He serves as Minister of the Court of Imperial Entertainments.

349
24:57.400 --> 24:58.480
(Zhao Xingtang's Invitation)

350
24:58.480 --> 25:00.200
My employer's wife is the granddaughter

351
25:00.200 --> 25:01.880
of Senior Grand Secretary Zhao.

352
25:06.440 --> 25:07.400
Zhao Xingtang?

353
25:15.920 --> 25:17.830
Madam Dai sent Young Madam an invitation.

354
25:18.070 --> 25:19.440
She's clearly up to no good.

355
25:20.110 --> 25:22.640
I'm afraid it won't be easy to buy Ji'er's freedom.

356
25:25.220 --> 25:27.850
Young Master, you have to think of something to help Young Madam.

357
25:27.860 --> 25:30.500
In the capital, Young Madam doesn't know anyone.

358
25:30.536 --> 25:32.200
She might not only fail to get Ji'er back,

359
25:32.232 --> 25:33.800
but end up at a serious disadvantage.

360
25:34.872 --> 25:36.984
That's exactly what I'm trying to figure out.

361
25:39.110 --> 25:40.880
Young Master, think of a way

362
25:43.310 --> 25:45.110
to get Ji'er back.

363
25:48.350 --> 25:49.480
If Young Madam is pleased,

364
25:49.960 --> 25:52.350
she might even let you move back into the bedroom.

365
25:54.000 --> 25:55.350
Don't become

366
25:55.464 --> 25:57.110
as much of a chatterbox as Jiugao.

367
26:17.920 --> 26:20.070
Does this outfit

368
26:21.310 --> 26:22.200
make me look younger?

369
26:23.912 --> 26:25.200
You don't need to look younger.

370
26:26.160 --> 26:27.550
You're already young, Young Master.

371
26:30.400 --> 26:31.750
Bring me the mirror. Let me see.

372
26:32.200 --> 26:33.000
All right.

373
26:44.550 --> 26:47.000
Zhao Xingtang sent me this invitation on purpose.

374
26:47.960 --> 26:49.240
She's mocking me

375
26:49.240 --> 26:51.200
for claiming I couldn't read back then.

376
26:52.830 --> 26:54.920
Even if Young Madam wasn't truthful back then,

377
26:55.032 --> 26:57.416
that's no reason for her to hold a grudge against you.

378
27:01.310 --> 27:02.480
She must believe

379
27:02.490 --> 27:04.680
I was the one who exposed her and caused her downfall.

380
27:05.400 --> 27:06.960
She must hate me deeply.

381
27:13.200 --> 27:14.000
Then what can we do?

382
27:15.110 --> 27:16.830
Does that mean we can't get Ji'er back?

383
27:24.240 --> 27:25.310
I have a way

384
27:25.960 --> 27:26.960
to make Madam Dai

385
27:27.440 --> 27:28.350
send Ji'er back.

386
27:38.440 --> 27:39.590
I'd like to hear it.

387
27:41.030 --> 27:43.720
Zhao Xingtang craves wealth and power.

388
27:44.400 --> 27:45.750
Now that she bears you a grudge,

389
27:46.240 --> 27:47.070
I'm afraid

390
27:47.480 --> 27:48.790
even an exorbitant offer

391
27:49.310 --> 27:50.400
wouldn't make her agree.

392
27:51.110 --> 27:53.640
So we'll have to use status to our advantage.

393
27:54.480 --> 27:56.720
As the wife of a court official,

394
27:57.240 --> 27:59.270
you could send the Empress a letter of thanks,

395
27:59.592 --> 28:01.128
stating that while you were in Jinling,

396
28:01.240 --> 28:02.960
His Majesty graciously saw justice done

397
28:02.970 --> 28:04.400
and bestowed a marriage upon you,

398
28:04.824 --> 28:06.590
and that now you've arrived in the capital,

399
28:06.824 --> 28:08.400
you wish to express your gratitude.

400
28:10.240 --> 28:12.510
It may look like a letter of thanks to the Empress,

401
28:12.640 --> 28:15.070
but His Majesty is sure to read it.

402
28:16.000 --> 28:17.830
You're now highly favored by His Majesty.

403
28:18.070 --> 28:20.000
He'll surely return the courtesy

404
28:21.110 --> 28:22.720
by finding some reason

405
28:23.070 --> 28:24.640
to have the Empress commend me.

406
28:24.968 --> 28:27.160
With an imperial decree from the Empress to protect me,

407
28:27.350 --> 28:28.880
if I ask for Ji'er back,

408
28:29.200 --> 28:31.030
even if Zhao Xingtang refuses,

409
28:31.350 --> 28:33.200
Senior Grand Secretary Zhao and Minister Dai

410
28:33.440 --> 28:35.350
will make her send Ji'er back.

411
28:36.720 --> 28:37.350
Yuchan.

412
28:46.480 --> 28:47.750
I can write it for you.

413
28:55.540 --> 28:59.660
(Xu respectfully bows in gratitude for Your Majesty's grace.)

414
29:14.960 --> 29:15.440
What?

415
29:15.800 --> 29:17.200
You want to write it yourself?

416
29:19.200 --> 29:20.240
This letter of thanks...

417
29:20.696 --> 29:21.830
I don't want to write it.

418
29:23.550 --> 29:24.110
Why?

419
29:25.640 --> 29:27.160
Don't you want to save Ji'er?

420
29:29.270 --> 29:30.720
I do want to save Ji'er,

421
29:32.480 --> 29:35.070
but don't do to others what you wouldn't want done to you.

422
29:39.960 --> 29:40.750
What do you mean?

423
29:41.880 --> 29:44.350
Please explain it clearly to me.

424
29:47.350 --> 29:48.750
You used an imperial decree

425
29:49.592 --> 29:51.510
to force my parents to agree to our marriage

426
29:51.960 --> 29:53.070
and forced me to marry you.

427
29:54.310 --> 29:56.070
If I use the same method,

428
29:56.880 --> 29:58.880
wouldn't that make me just like you?

429
30:06.590 --> 30:07.720
And what kind of person am I?

430
30:10.070 --> 30:11.270
You rely on power

431
30:12.510 --> 30:13.880
to take whatever you want by force.

432
30:34.640 --> 30:35.640
So in your heart,

433
30:37.480 --> 30:38.830
only Han Liang

434
30:40.440 --> 30:42.030
is a true gentleman.

435
30:45.310 --> 30:47.110
What does Scholar Han have to do with this?

436
30:47.200 --> 30:49.400
What does any of this have to do with Scholar Han, huh?

437
30:57.750 --> 31:00.110
Isn't it because you still can't let go of him

438
31:06.240 --> 31:08.160
that you resent me for using my power

439
31:11.400 --> 31:12.830
to take what I wanted by force?

440
31:17.272 --> 31:18.510
What are you trying to do?

441
31:19.550 --> 31:20.240
Move.

442
31:26.310 --> 31:27.110
Move.

443
31:29.480 --> 31:31.790
Move!

444
31:37.200 --> 31:38.000
Xu Lanxiang.

445
31:39.350 --> 31:40.920
You are already my lawfully wedded wife,

446
31:40.920 --> 31:42.920
married to me, Lin Fengtai, with all due rites.

447
31:45.350 --> 31:47.070
You should put those thoughts

448
31:49.030 --> 31:50.350
out of your mind.

449
32:15.070 --> 32:15.960
If my parents

450
32:17.110 --> 32:19.350
held official rank like Master and First Madam,

451
32:20.232 --> 32:23.130
even if they weren't high-ranking officials of the second or third rank,

452
32:23.140 --> 32:25.160
but merely a fourth-rank Prefectural Vice Governor

453
32:25.176 --> 32:26.530
or fifth-rank Assistant Governor,

454
32:27.030 --> 32:29.310
would you have married me without even asking my parents

455
32:30.270 --> 32:31.590
or telling them beforehand?

456
32:35.030 --> 32:37.830
You think obtaining an imperial decree

457
32:38.720 --> 32:40.720
and marrying me properly as your wife

458
32:41.350 --> 32:43.000
shows me the greatest respect.

459
32:45.920 --> 32:48.350
But if I were the daughter of a Grand Secretary or Minister,

460
32:50.350 --> 32:51.920
would you still have done the same?

461
33:17.336 --> 33:20.216
Why is it that if I were the daughter of a Grand Secretary or Minister,

462
33:20.880 --> 33:22.510
you would think

463
33:23.000 --> 33:25.680
it's wrong to marry me by force without asking my wishes,

464
33:27.550 --> 33:29.480
yet when it's me, you call it respect

465
33:30.440 --> 33:31.440
and an honor?

466
33:43.270 --> 33:44.830
If you disdain my method,

467
33:47.000 --> 33:48.110
I'd like to see

468
33:48.750 --> 33:50.160
how you'll avoid relying on power

469
33:51.400 --> 33:53.510
and get your benefactor back

470
33:53.944 --> 33:56.160
from Senior Grand Secretary Zhao's granddaughter,

471
33:57.310 --> 33:58.590
the wife of Minister Dai.

472
34:37.960 --> 34:39.320
Madam, this way, please.

473
34:54.020 --> 34:57.060
(Xiaofurong Troupe Theater, the Capital)

474
35:00.776 --> 35:02.456
I'd heard before that here in the capital,

475
35:02.472 --> 35:04.710
you've made quite a name for Southern Opera.

476
35:05.360 --> 35:07.440
Now that I've seen you, I know it's true.

477
35:07.512 --> 35:10.030
(Xiao Shunqing, performer of the Xiaofurong Troupe) Our troupe leader is a disciple of Furong.

478
35:10.030 --> 35:12.590
No one in the capital performs Southern Opera better.

479
35:14.000 --> 35:14.840
That's wonderful.

480
35:15.150 --> 35:16.590
Whenever I get homesick,

481
35:16.710 --> 35:18.250
I'll come here to see a performance.

482
35:18.280 --> 35:20.280
Of course. Madam, please have a seat.

483
35:30.400 --> 35:30.840
Please.

484
35:35.630 --> 35:37.070
We've found out everything

485
35:37.096 --> 35:38.536
you asked us to look into.

486
35:39.800 --> 35:41.710
Minister Dai was demoted two ranks

487
35:41.710 --> 35:42.800
because of his youngest son.

488
35:43.190 --> 35:44.550
But once the matter blew over,

489
35:44.550 --> 35:46.770
Senior Grand Secretary Zhao helped him return to office

490
35:46.780 --> 35:49.368
and he was promoted to Minister of the Court of Imperial Entertainments.

491
35:51.510 --> 35:52.510
What about Madam Dai?

492
35:54.728 --> 35:56.056
Minister Dai has four sons.

493
35:56.104 --> 35:58.392
His second and third sons are posted outside the capital.

494
35:58.920 --> 36:00.670
Only his eldest son remains in the capital,

495
36:00.680 --> 36:02.792
serving as Judicial Officer of Shuntian Prefecture.

496
36:03.030 --> 36:05.000
He's more than ten years older than Madam Dai.

497
36:05.440 --> 36:06.960
Now that Madam Dai runs the household,

498
36:07.000 --> 36:09.448
his eldest son and daughter-in-law are unhappy about it.

499
36:09.960 --> 36:12.400
Minister Dai may seem to dote on Madam Dai,

500
36:12.630 --> 36:14.960
and he even lets her manage the family's shops.

501
36:15.070 --> 36:16.550
But they married later in life

502
36:16.630 --> 36:17.840
and have no children together.

503
36:17.920 --> 36:19.816
How much genuine affection could there be?

504
36:23.656 --> 36:25.510
The accountants and shopkeepers in those shops

505
36:25.510 --> 36:26.872
are all members of the Dai family.

506
36:27.000 --> 36:29.880
Madam Dai merely puts on a fine appearance

507
36:29.880 --> 36:31.070
for the outside world.

508
36:33.630 --> 36:34.590
Thank you for your help.

509
36:36.360 --> 36:37.190
Not at all.

510
36:37.510 --> 36:39.190
I'm also a grand-disciple of Furong.

511
36:39.230 --> 36:40.360
By helping you,

512
36:40.360 --> 36:42.400
I'm also showing my respect to Furong.

513
36:43.416 --> 36:45.960
Besides, Mister Lu wrote to us personally with instructions.

514
36:46.480 --> 36:47.360
Our troupe leader said

515
36:47.440 --> 36:49.280
you need only ask if you ever need our help.

516
36:52.190 --> 36:52.710
Yuchan.

517
36:54.840 --> 36:58.150
You said before that Zhao Xingtang, before coming to the capital,

518
36:58.400 --> 37:00.550
wrote asking for Qingxiang back.

519
37:01.000 --> 37:02.904
Yes. Second Butler Yang said

520
37:02.936 --> 37:05.360
he and Qingxiang could no longer live as husband and wife,

521
37:05.440 --> 37:07.030
so he readily wrote a divorce agreement

522
37:07.440 --> 37:09.920
and returned Qingxiang's indenture to Zhao Xingtang.

523
37:13.000 --> 37:14.070
Is something wrong?

524
37:20.400 --> 37:21.230
Nothing's wrong.

525
37:21.640 --> 37:22.936
It makes perfect sense.

526
37:27.190 --> 37:31.630
♪I must take my leave before you♪

527
37:32.800 --> 37:33.960
Please have a seat, Madam.

528
37:34.190 --> 37:35.920
I'll go see if our troupe leader is back.

529
37:36.760 --> 37:37.440
Go ahead.

530
37:43.440 --> 37:45.670
Zhao Xingtang is overbearing and domineering.

531
37:45.760 --> 37:48.440
With Senior Grand Secretary Zhao and Minister Dai backing her,

532
37:48.630 --> 37:50.320
and Ji'er's indenture in her hands,

533
37:51.280 --> 37:53.710
you've only just arrived in the capital

534
37:53.880 --> 37:56.030
and don't have much to work with.

535
37:57.150 --> 37:58.360
I've been thinking.

536
37:58.710 --> 38:00.800
Maybe we should take Young Master's advice

537
38:01.190 --> 38:02.630
and use the Empress's influence

538
38:03.000 --> 38:04.840
to get Ji'er back as soon as possible.

539
38:06.550 --> 38:09.510
So you think there's nothing wrong with using power against others?

540
38:12.880 --> 38:14.360
I wouldn't call it that.

541
38:15.230 --> 38:17.510
Besides, doesn't everyone do the same?

542
38:17.760 --> 38:20.550
When you're in trouble and lack the power to handle it yourself,

543
38:20.840 --> 38:22.480
you have no choice but to find a way

544
38:22.480 --> 38:24.070
to seek help from someone more powerful.

545
38:27.760 --> 38:30.360
Zhao Xingtang is unpredictable.

546
38:30.630 --> 38:31.880
If Ji'er remains in her hands,

547
38:31.880 --> 38:33.608
the longer we wait, the greater the risk.

548
38:33.670 --> 38:36.320
Who knows what else might happen?

549
38:43.230 --> 38:44.760
You have a point.

550
38:49.840 --> 38:51.630
Let's go to Minister Dai's residence now

551
38:51.630 --> 38:52.920
and get Ji'er back.

552
38:58.000 --> 38:58.800
Young Madam.

553
39:01.660 --> 39:05.740
(Dai Residence, the Capital)

554
39:29.150 --> 39:31.150
Madam, Madam Lin is here.

555
39:32.110 --> 39:32.960
Madam Dai.

556
39:44.230 --> 39:45.400
Good!

557
39:45.480 --> 39:46.440
Impressive!

558
39:46.550 --> 39:48.360
Xingtang is getting better and better.

559
39:48.480 --> 39:49.960
Mother is really going to win.

560
39:54.030 --> 39:55.230
Lanxiang is here.

561
39:55.960 --> 39:57.320
Look at me.

562
39:57.710 --> 39:59.590
I didn't even recognize you at first.

563
40:00.360 --> 40:02.440
Clothes really do make the person.

564
40:03.360 --> 40:06.280
All dressed up like this,

565
40:06.480 --> 40:08.510
you really do look like an official's wife.

566
40:12.670 --> 40:14.960
Madam Dai, it's been a long time.

567
40:25.150 --> 40:26.280
When I heard you were coming,

568
40:26.360 --> 40:28.880
I had the maids prepare the mallets

569
40:28.936 --> 40:30.968
so we could play chuiwan together. [*Ancient Chinese golf]

570
40:31.320 --> 40:32.710
Luckily, Qingxiang reminded me

571
40:33.030 --> 40:35.480
that you don't know how to play.

572
40:38.408 --> 40:40.110
Xingtang, you're teasing people again.

573
40:40.110 --> 40:42.070
(Zhao Xingluo, Xie Zhao's wife, Zhao Xingtang's sister) Every lady knows how to play chuiwan.

574
40:44.960 --> 40:45.480
Come.

575
40:46.400 --> 40:47.280
Let me introduce

576
40:47.280 --> 40:48.960
this young lady to you all.

577
40:50.030 --> 40:52.320
You've all heard plenty about her.

578
40:52.488 --> 40:53.912
She's the one whose marriage

579
40:53.960 --> 40:56.392
was bestowed by His Majesty after he ascended the throne.

580
40:56.420 --> 40:59.280
(Zhang Liu, wife of Chen Qi, Commander of the Shenji Battalion)

581
40:59.280 --> 41:01.150
So you're Assistant Commander Lin's wife.

582
41:02.328 --> 41:04.510
His Majesty has certainly shown you great favor.

583
41:04.670 --> 41:07.150
(Yin Lan'e, Dai Rong's wife) Just a touch of imperial favor

584
41:07.160 --> 41:08.440
can lift a sparrow onto a branch

585
41:08.920 --> 41:09.960
and turn it into a phoenix.

586
41:09.960 --> 41:11.760
No wonder Madam Lin can't play chuiwan.

587
41:12.230 --> 41:13.150
Xingtang,

588
41:13.480 --> 41:15.110
when Madam Lin served you,

589
41:15.110 --> 41:16.710
you should've taught her.

590
41:18.630 --> 41:19.550
My mistake.

591
41:20.110 --> 41:21.030
My mistake.

592
41:22.070 --> 41:23.230
You should get to know

593
41:23.230 --> 41:25.070
Madam Chen well.

594
41:25.320 --> 41:26.440
Her husband

595
41:26.670 --> 41:29.710
is Assistant Commander Lin's superior, Deputy Commander Chen.

596
41:32.920 --> 41:35.000
Madam Chen, this is our first meeting.

597
41:35.208 --> 41:36.648
Please forgive my discourtesy.

598
41:38.280 --> 41:39.150
Not at all.

599
41:39.832 --> 41:41.880
Assistant Commander Lin enjoys His Majesty's trust

600
41:41.890 --> 41:43.480
and has a bright future ahead.

601
41:43.960 --> 41:45.510
We're the ones who've been remiss.

602
41:46.510 --> 41:48.030
Though we're all in the capital,

603
41:48.230 --> 41:50.510
you've never paid a visit to my residence.

604
41:51.688 --> 41:54.070
No wonder we didn't recognize each other when we met.

605
41:55.710 --> 41:56.760
Madam Lin

606
41:57.510 --> 41:59.030
comes from humble origins, after all,

607
41:59.110 --> 42:00.710
so she doesn't know these rules yet.

608
42:01.480 --> 42:02.960
Madam Chen, you can teach her.

609
42:06.510 --> 42:07.710
It's all my fault.

610
42:10.320 --> 42:11.840
She once served as my maid.

611
42:11.960 --> 42:14.710
Had I known she'd become the madam of a household,

612
42:14.960 --> 42:16.440
I would've taught her properly

613
42:16.440 --> 42:18.550
how to manage a household and conduct herself.

614
42:21.960 --> 42:23.110
I've only just arrived,

615
42:23.120 --> 42:25.360
so I truly don't know the customs of the capital.

616
42:26.030 --> 42:27.320
After all, in Jinling,

617
42:27.440 --> 42:29.960
the wife of a disgraced criminal like Fourth Madam Dai

618
42:30.072 --> 42:31.128
would never be invited by

619
42:31.190 --> 42:33.710
a Deputy Commander's wife to play chuiwan.

620
42:37.496 --> 42:39.030
I'm suddenly feeling a little tired.

621
42:39.624 --> 42:41.110
